<title>UK: LW Rentenbank adds 50 bln lire to structured bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank adds 50 bln lire to structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following structured callable has been increased to 300 billion lire from 250 billion lire joint lead managers Credito Italiano and Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT ***300 BLN LIRE  COUPON    *10.00     MATURITY   *20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**101.50    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER  **99.825    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ   *ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 20.FEB.00 AFTER WHICH DEAL BECOMES A</p>
<p>		REVERSE FRN PAYING 19.50 PCT MINUS (2X 6M LIBOR).</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE AND REOFFER PRICE</p>
<p>	   ***LAUNCHED FOR 200 BILLION LIRE 15.JAN.96 AND FURTHER</p>
<p>		INCREASED ON 16.JAN.97 BY 50 BILLION LIRE.</p>
